 "body": [
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "attributes": {},
   "children": [
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_1",
      "label": "DCS 1"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "mahāsāhasavṛttyā svarūpalābhaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "Through the activity of <s>Mahāsāhasa</s> (great audacity), one's own true nature is attained.",
       "segment_number": 67986
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_2",
      "label": "DCS 2"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "tallābhāc churitā yudyugapad vṛttipravṛttiḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "The operation of the <s>vṛttis</s> (cognitive movements), suffused by that attainment, proceeds all at once.",
       "segment_number": 67987
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_3",
      "label": "DCS 3"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "ubhayapaṭṭodghaṭṭanān mahāśūnyatāpraveśaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "By opening the two coverings, there is entry into <s>mahāśūnyatā</s> (the great void).",
       "segment_number": 67988
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_4",
      "label": "DCS 4"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "yugmagrāsān niravakāśasaṃvinniṣṭhā ||",
       "translated_text": "By consuming the pair, there is steadfastness in unobstructed <s>saṃvid</s> (consciousness).",
       "segment_number": 67989
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_5",
      "label": "DCS 5"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "siddhayoginīsaṃghaṭṭān mahāmelāpodayaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "Through the conjunction of <s>siddhas</s> and <s>yoginīs</s>, the <s>mahāmelāpa</s> (great union) arises.",
       "segment_number": 67990
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_6",
      "label": "DCS 6"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "trikañcukaparityāgān nirākhyapadāvasthitiḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "Through abandoning the three <s>kañcukas</s> (coverings), there is abiding in the nameless state.",
       "segment_number": 67991
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_7",
      "label": "DCS 7"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "vākcatuṣṭayodayavirāmaprathāsu svaraḥ prathate ||",
       "translated_text": "In the manifestations of the arising and cessation of the fourfold speech, <s>svara</s> (the primal tone) reveals itself.",
       "segment_number": 67992
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_8",
      "label": "DCS 8"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "rasatritayāsvādanenānicchocchalitaṃ vigatabandhaṃ paraṃ brahma ||",
       "translated_text": "Through tasting the three <s>rasas</s> (essences), the supreme <s>Brahman</s> wells up without volition, free from bondage.",
       "segment_number": 67993
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_9",
      "label": "DCS 9"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "devīcatuṣṭayollāsena sadaiva svaviśrāntyavasthitiḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "With the flashing forth of the four <s>devīs</s> (goddesses), one always abides in one's own repose.",
       "segment_number": 67994
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_10",
      "label": "DCS 10"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "dvādaśavāhodayena mahāmarīcivikāsaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "Through the arising of the <s>dvādaśavāha</s> (twelvefold current), the great rays unfold.",
       "segment_number": 67995
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_11",
      "label": "DCS 11"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "caryāpañcakodaye nistaraṅgasamāveśaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "When the fivefold <s>caryā</s> (conduct) arises, there is wave-free absorption.",
       "segment_number": 67996
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_12",
      "label": "DCS 12"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "mahābodhasamāveśāt puṇyapāpāsaṃbandhaḥ ||",
       "translated_text": "Through immersion in <s>mahābodha</s> (great awakening), there is no connection with merit or sin.",
       "segment_number": 67997
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tag": "lg",
     "attributes": {
      "id": "DCS_13",
      "label": "DCS 13"
     },
     "children": [
      {
       "tag": "l",
       "attributes": {},
       "text": "akathanakathābalena mahāvismayamudrāprāptyā khasvaratā ||",
       "translated_text": "By the power of the unutterable teaching and by attaining the seal of great wonder, there is <s>khasvaratā</s> (the space-resonance state).",
       "segment_number": 67998
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
